{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/TitleScreen.yarn-Title_Screen_NewGame-2743": "开始游戏",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/TitleScreen.yarn-Title_Screen_NewGame-2744": "新周目",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/TitleScreen.yarn-Title_Screen_NewGame-2745": "取消",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5693": "<align=\"center\">选择游戏难度<br>（可随时在设置菜单中更改。）<br></align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5694": "轻松——轻松体验故事",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5695": "普通——体验经典回合制战斗",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5696": "困难——适合寻求额外挑战的 RPG 老手",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5697": "噩梦——新周目专属挑战！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5698": "KERAUNOS: 快到山顶了，科尔辛将军一定就在附近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5699": "HAELAN: 几千年了，还没人登上过这座山顶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5700": "HAELAN: 我感觉到……一种异样的气息。听说这里有某种古老的魔法，像是诅咒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5701": "KERAUNOS: 我也感觉到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5702": "LE DERNIER: 科尔辛打算拿这诅咒做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5703": "LE DERNIER: 把它释放出来祸害全人类，好让自己在王座上多坐几个月？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5704": "LE DERNIER: 要不是这念头实在丧心病狂，他这点念想倒也可悲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueStart-5705": "HEIZER: 那就把这条恶狗宰了，省得他再祸害人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5706": "CORSIN: 哦？瞧瞧，谁来了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5707": "CORSIN: 能让你们四个一起来到这里，看来你们的同盟这次是认真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5708": "KERAUNOS: 不管你在做什么，立刻停手，放下武器！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5709": "CORSIN: 这种话我听过无数次了，可哪次成真了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5710": "HAELAN: 看见了吗？感觉到了吗？这股元素的力量……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5711": "HAELAN: 所有力量正汇聚于此！它曾毁灭希纳尔，你绝对控制不了它！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5712": "CORSIN: 亲爱的，若这是我头一回发动革命，我倒会同意你——可惜，这不是头一回了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5713": "CORSIN: 来吧，看看我能不能再创造一次奇迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5714": "CORSIN: 好吧，你们赢了，把我的剑拿去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5715": "CORSIN: 这个世界终于要迎来清算了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5716": "HEIZER: 这种体面，你不配。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5717": "LE DERNIER: 古斯塔夫！你干了什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5718": "HEIZER: 做了我来这里要做的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5719": "HAELAN: 那现在……怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5720": "HEIZER: 你自己也说了，元素的力量……魔法的力量，正汇聚在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5721": "HEIZER: 所以，真正的问题是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-corsinBattle-5722": "<align=\"center\">……我们该拿它怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueSoldier1-5723": "SOLDIER: 进攻！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueSoldier2-5724": "SOLDIER: 只要我还有一口气，就休想过去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueTurnaround-5725": "KERAUNOS: 都走到这一步了，可不能现在回头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueTurnaround-5726": "HAELAN: 我们还是别做傻事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueTurnaround-5727": "LE DERNIER: 眼下最糟糕的选择，就是放弃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/prologue/Prologue.yarn-prologueTurnaround-5728": "HEIZER: 现在可不是退缩的时候！"
}
